  "label": "Harvey Price is mapped as the subject of growth comparison",
  "description": "The text 'this is how harvey price has grown over the years' explicitly identifies the young Black boy in both images as Harvey Price, establishing him as the central entity being compared across time. The visual material (top and bottom images) shows his physical appearance at different stages, mapping directly onto the textual claim of growth. This is a direct analogical mapping where the text names the visual subject and frames the visual comparison.",
